<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0260_P01R0302_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Captain, play with me, PLEASE?\rI’m BORED! I’m SO bored! I’m gon’\nDIE!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0260_P01R0302_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh, you gon’ play with me?\rLet’s play hide-and-seek!\nI’ll hide, so close your eyes!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0260_P01R0302_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh, you gon’ play with me?\rLet’s play hide-and-seek!\nI’ll hide, so close your eyes!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0260_P01R0302_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh, you gon’ play with me?\rLet’s play hide-and-seek!\nI’ll hide, so close your eyes!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0260_P01R0302_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This lil girl keep askin’ me to play\nwith her.\rOw! Quit pullin’ my EAR! I’m STEERIN’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0260_P01R0302_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks for playin’ with her.\rYou think bein’ Captain is easy, but\nit’s actually mad demandin’.\fI gotta steer AND babysit.\rThat lil passenger left the room.\rShe can’t get off the ship, so she\nhidin’ somewhere. Prob’ly in the\fengine.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0260_P01R0302_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">How you like the S.S. Aqua’s ride?\rShe basically SKATE across the waves.\nShe also leak. A lil.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0260_P01R0302_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Long time no see.\nHow you been?\rThe S.S. Aqua smooth as\nshe can be!\rBy the way, I found this weird\nthing when I went to Sinnoh\fthe other day.\rNow that we ran into each other,\nI want you to have it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0260_P01R0302_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your Bag full.\rYou must REALLY like the {STRVAR_1 8, 1, 0}.</language>
	</row>
</body>
